            <li><strong>/docs/*</strong> - 30+ documentation pages</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="column">
        <div class="column-header">Account Portal (Protected - SSR)</div>
        <ul class="bullet-list">
            <li><strong>/dashboard</strong> - Overview, usage, upgrade options</li>
            <li><strong>/dashboard/licenses</strong> - License keys, activations</li>
            <li><strong>/dashboard/billing</strong> - Payment history, invoices</li>
            <li><strong>/dashboard/team</strong> - Team management (Business+)</li>
            <li><strong>/dashboard/settings</strong> - Profile, preferences</li>
            <li><strong>/checkout</strong> - Stripe checkout flow</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- slide -->
<div class="slide-header">Registration <span class="accent">Flow</span></div>
<div class="flow-horizontal">
    <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-step-title">/register</div>
        <div class="flow-step-desc">Company email</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow">&#8594;</div>
    <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-step-title">API Call</div>
        <div class="flow-step-desc">Send verification</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow">&#8594;</div>
    <div class="flow-step flow-step-active">
        <div class="flow-step-title">/verify</div>
        <div class="flow-step-desc">6-digit code</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow">&#8594;</div>
    <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-step-title">/success</div>
        <div class="flow-step-desc">License key shown</div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="callout" style="margin-top: 24px;">
    <div class="callout-title">Company Email Validation</div>
    <div class="callout-text">70+ personal email domains blocked (Gmail, Yahoo, Outlook, etc.). Only company emails allowed to ensure B2B focus and lead quality.</div>
</div>
<ul class="bullet-list" style="margin-top: 16px;">
    <li><strong>6-character code</strong> valid for 24 hours</li>
    <li><strong>Max 3 attempts</strong> per code, <strong>5 codes</strong> per email per day</li>
    <li>License key displayed on success page for desktop client activation</li>
</ul>

<!-- slide -->
<div class="slide-header">API <span class="accent">Integration</span></div>
<div class="two-column">
    <div class="column">
        <div class="column-header">Website API Endpoints</div>
        <ul class="bullet-list">
            <li><strong>POST /api/website/register</strong> - New user</li>
            <li><strong>POST /api/website/verify</strong> - Verify code</li>
            <li><strong>POST /api/website/login</strong> - License key login</li>
            <li><strong>POST /api/website/logout</strong> - Clear session</li>
            <li><strong>GET /api/website/me</strong> - Current user</li>
            <li><strong>GET /api/website/tiers</strong> - All tiers (public)</li>
            <li><strong>GET /api/website/tier</strong> - Current tier + usage</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="column">
        <div class="column-header">Authentication</div>
        <ul class="bullet-list">
            <li><strong>HttpOnly cookies</strong> set by API</li>
            <li><strong>CORS protected</strong> endpoints</li>
            <li><strong>No OmniToken required</strong> for web endpoints</li>
            <li>Automatic redirect to <strong>/login</strong> on 401</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="callout" style="margin-top: 16px;">
            <div class="callout-title">Stripe Integration</div>
            <div class="callout-text">Uses Stripe Checkout (hosted) - not custom payment forms. Webhooks handle subscription updates.</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

