<!-- slide -->
<div class="slide-header">Critical <span class="accent">Rules</span></div>
<div class="card-grid card-grid-2">
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">Separate Project</div>
        <div class="card-desc">This is the public website, NOT the internal Portal. Different codebase, different concerns.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">API Consumer Only</div>
        <div class="card-desc">Website calls api.omnigaze.com. It does NOT access the database directly.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">SEO Critical</div>
        <div class="card-desc">Marketing pages MUST be statically generated. Use SSG for landing, pricing, features, docs.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">Stripe Checkout (Hosted)</div>
        <div class="card-desc">Use Stripe's hosted checkout, NOT custom payment forms. Reduces PCI compliance burden.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">Pyramid is Key</div>
        <div class="card-desc">The value pyramid MUST be prominently featured on landing and features pages. It's our core differentiator.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">Email Required</div>
        <div class="card-desc">All tiers including Community require verified company email. No personal emails allowed.</div>
    </div>
</div>

